    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span>\n    <span class=\"time\">50 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Concurrency</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Asked at Cleartrip, Uber</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Concurrent Collections &amp; Atomics (CAS)</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Why <code>ConcurrentHashMap</code> can still lose your updates, how one CPU instruction (compare-and-swap) replaces a lock, when <code>LongAdder</code> beats <code>AtomicLong</code>, what the ABA problem is, and which concurrent collection to reach for in a machine-coding round.</p>\n"
